.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.claude/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
**/_extract/
**/_tiff/
**/_sol/
# Answer source docs stay local (not needed in the repo).
# Broad on purpose: a singular "week2_solution.pages" once slipped past the
# plural-only patterns and got published to the public repo.
**/solutions_*.pages
**/*_solution.pages
**/*_solutions.pages
# Catch-all: any .pages whose name mentions a solution, whatever the suffix.
# "week4_solutions NEW.pages" slipped past the patterns above on 2026-09-15.
**/*[Ss]olution*.pages
